A note on scientific content, which the licence does not address:

Not every routine in this codebase is validated. Of the 75 domain modules, 31
carry computational capabilities pinned to hand-computed reference values, 17
declare `NO_IMPLEMENTATION`, and 27 return curated reference text at
`provenance='descriptive'` with no analysis performed. Anything marked
`# AUDIT-FLAG:` in the source is known-suspect and deliberately left unfixed
rather than papered over. See `BASELINE_README.md` -> "Known limitations".

